这种分子就是--
of all life on earth --

32
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:38,570
液态水(H2O)。
liquid H20 water.

33
00:02:38,570 --> 00:02:41,560
小时候，每个夏天我都要
When I was a kid, I would spend, like, every summer

34
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:44,240
每天在湖里游5个小时的泳，
maybe five hours a day swimming in the lakes,

35
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:46,330
在水里玩耍。
just playing around in the water.

36
00:02:46,330 --> 00:02:50,410
那些日子里，我很喜欢待在水里，
And these days, I love just to hang out in the water.

37
00:02:50,420 --> 00:02:52,870
这种感觉非常奇妙，
It's just a beautiful experience

38
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:56,740
似乎自己的身体都融在了水里。
to feel like your body's dissolving into the water.

39
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:01,380
当Anders成为了一名化学家，
When Anders became a chemist,

40
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:04,180
他对水更加着迷了。
his obsession with water grew even deeper.

41
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:07,010
水分子之间
Water has this ability

42
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:09,180
能够形成氢键，
to form what's called hydrogen bonds,

43
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:11,600
即一个水分子的氢原子
where a hydrogen atom in one water molecule

44
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:14,610
